    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a standard action, the dark knight causes an area to explode with the power of the Abyss dealing 1d6 points of shadow damage plus an additional 1d6 points of shadow damage per four dark knight levels to those within a 20-ft.-radius. Enemies in the area of effect must make a Fortitude save (DC 10 + half of the dark knight's level + his Charisma modifier) to reduce the damage by half. The dark knight is healed half the damage dealt of the total to all affected. This ability has a range of 50 feet.</p>",
